     "angle sum",
     "equilateral",
     "isosceles"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "The angles of a triangle add up to 180 degrees. Tear the corners and put them together to see a straight line.\nBy angles, a triangle is acute, right or obtuse. By sides it is equilateral, isosceles or scalene.\nIf two angles are 50 and 60 degrees the third is 180 minus 110, which is 70 degrees."
    }
